From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xray-studio <xray-studio@localhost>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 05:03:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] xraytrace: add optional telemetry hooks for embedders

New stdlib-only package so any Xray package can import it without a cycle.
Provides nil-by-default hook vars for probe events, balancer decisions and
routing rule matches, plus a nil-safe Trace accumulator and a context marker
that identifies probe-originated dials.

Unset hooks cost one nil compare and change no behaviour.
